    "text": "The value of <math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi>π</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
